1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,699
The Arctic Flask 500 is a vacuum insulated bottle that keeps drinks hot for 12 hours.

2
00:00:07,099 --> 00:00:11,778
Two stainless steel walls are welded together with a vacuum gap between them.

3
00:00:11,578 --> 00:00:17,406
Because there is almost no air in the gap, heat cannot travel by conduction or convection.

4
00:00:18,406 --> 00:00:22,894
A copper coating on the inner wall reflects radiant heat back into the drink.

5
00:00:23,294 --> 00:00:29,728
The Polar Flask 500 holds half a litre and weighs just under 310 grams when empty.

